PipeWire and SPA headers (vendored subset)
===========================================

Source:   https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire  (release 1.0.5,
          as shipped by Ubuntu 24.04 in libpipewire-0.3-dev / libspa-0.2-dev)
Contents: only the header files that src-native/audio_capture_linux.cc
          includes, directly or transitively (90 files), unmodified.
Purpose:  compile-time declarations for a PipeWire client that is loaded with
          dlopen("libpipewire-0.3.so.0") at run time. No PipeWire code is
          linked into, or distributed with, the addon.
License:  MIT ("Expat"). Every vendored file carries
          "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT" and its own copyright line
          (Wim Taymans, Collabora, Red Hat and other PipeWire contributors).

